1
00:01:36,860 --> 00:01:38,860
[The Lament of Autumn]

2
00:01:39,390 --> 00:01:41,830
[Episode 18]

3
00:01:57,650 --> 00:01:59,850
How long are you going to keep kneeling?

4
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:03,060
It's been all night.

5
00:02:05,260 --> 00:02:07,260
Chanting the sutras a few more times

6
00:02:08,310 --> 00:02:09,910
will show the Bodhisattva

7
00:02:09,910 --> 00:02:11,520
how sincere I am.

8
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:13,910
The Bodhisattva has seen it.

9
00:02:13,910 --> 00:02:14,650
Get up.

10
00:02:22,410 --> 00:02:24,030
Bodhisattva, please bless

11
00:02:24,060 --> 00:02:25,310
my Changxuan

12
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:27,960
to return safely soon.

13
00:02:29,579 --> 00:02:31,750
He is the only boy in our family.

14
00:02:32,410 --> 00:02:34,210
His father went to war.

15
00:02:34,710 --> 00:02:36,460
His brother went to war.

16
00:02:37,460 --> 00:02:38,930
Sooner or later,

17
00:02:38,930 --> 00:02:40,560
he will have to face this day.

18
00:02:42,470 --> 00:02:44,750
I know you are his superior,

19
00:02:46,130 --> 00:02:48,130
the commander of the Yu Army.

20
00:02:50,470 --> 00:02:53,680
I am just a mother

21
00:02:55,370 --> 00:02:57,520
who only hopes her son

22
00:02:58,870 --> 00:03:01,500
can return safely soon.

23
00:03:27,250 --> 00:03:28,430
Keep up!

24
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:30,190
Hurry!

25
00:03:31,630 --> 00:03:32,520
Run faster!

26
00:03:39,310 --> 00:03:40,210
Take cover!

27
00:03:40,690 --> 00:03:41,620
Take cover!

28
00:03:41,620 --> 00:03:44,280
Spread out!

29
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,600
Protect the Army Commander!

30
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:50,410
Hurry!

31
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:24,720
Xuewu.

32
00:04:25,060 --> 00:04:26,120
Any bullets left?

33
00:04:26,150 --> 00:04:27,470
No, nothing left.

34
00:04:32,830 --> 00:04:34,120
They are out of bullets!

35
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:35,470
Yu Zhongquan's son—

36
00:04:35,690 --> 00:04:37,150
we must capture him alive!

37
00:04:37,310 --> 00:04:38,120
By then,

38
00:04:38,180 --> 00:04:39,909
we will make Yu Zhongquan watch

39
00:04:40,310 --> 00:04:42,250
as we cut off his son's head!

40
00:04:42,930 --> 00:04:43,730
Fix bayonets!

41
00:04:43,810 --> 00:04:44,360
Yes!

42
00:05:41,370 --> 00:05:42,830
Scholar!

43
00:05:43,630 --> 00:05:44,430
Scholar!

44
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:45,480
Scholar!

45
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:47,060
Brother!

46
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:48,040
Brother!

47
00:05:48,690 --> 00:05:49,130
Brother!

48
00:05:49,130 --> 00:05:49,690
Scholar!

49
00:05:50,890 --> 00:05:51,620
Scholar!

50
00:06:03,370 --> 00:06:04,180
This...

51
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,560
You promised me.

52
00:06:07,420 --> 00:06:08,130
Scholar.

53
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:11,720
I will definitely deliver your letter
to your family!

54
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:20,220
Brother...

55
00:06:22,060 --> 00:06:22,690
Go...

56
00:06:23,390 --> 00:06:23,890
Go!

57
00:06:23,980 --> 00:06:25,360
Let's go, Army Commander!

58
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:26,510
Army Commander, let's go!

59
00:06:26,510 --> 00:06:27,430
Scholar!

60
00:06:27,810 --> 00:06:28,870
Retreat! Retreat!

61
00:07:16,250 --> 00:07:16,980
Yuan Huai!

62
00:07:18,870 --> 00:07:19,530
Brother!

63
00:07:19,870 --> 00:07:20,520
Brother!

64
00:07:24,770 --> 00:07:25,500
Brother!

65
00:07:31,430 --> 00:07:32,490
Army Commander...

66
00:07:33,390 --> 00:07:35,920
Make sure these get delivered.

67
00:07:46,890 --> 00:07:47,820
Army Commander.

68
00:07:50,430 --> 00:07:51,500
In our next lives,

69
00:07:53,190 --> 00:07:55,830
we must...

70
00:07:59,300 --> 00:08:00,270
grow...

71
00:08:02,070 --> 00:08:02,600
wheat...

72
00:08:04,500 --> 00:08:05,430
in Nanhuai City.

73
00:08:40,530 --> 00:08:47,320
♪ Mother, who knows
how much you miss me? ♪

74
00:08:48,770 --> 00:08:55,150
♪ I dream of you, Mother, in my sleep ♪

75
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:58,390
♪ Mother ♪

76
00:08:58,390 --> 00:08:59,460
Guan Bao!

77
00:09:04,390 --> 00:09:05,240
Guan Bao!

78
00:09:26,340 --> 00:09:27,510
Yu Changxuan is over there!

79
00:09:27,510 --> 00:09:28,290
Hurry!

80
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,390
Get him!

81
00:09:59,780 --> 00:10:00,510
Changxuan!

82
00:10:01,750 --> 00:10:02,410
Changxuan!

83
00:10:08,890 --> 00:10:09,980
Their reinforcements are here!

84
00:10:09,980 --> 00:10:11,360
Retreat! Retreat!

85
00:10:38,530 --> 00:10:39,130
Xueting,

86
00:10:39,390 --> 00:10:40,250
it's been a long time

87
00:10:40,250 --> 00:10:42,110
since you came to pick up Pingjun.

88
00:10:42,500 --> 00:10:43,600
I've been busy lately.

89
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:44,940
I have some free time today,

90
00:10:44,940 --> 00:10:46,050
so I'm taking her out for a meal.

91
00:10:46,050 --> 00:10:47,740
What a model boyfriend.

92
00:10:48,100 --> 00:10:48,730
Bye.

93
00:10:51,150 --> 00:10:52,290
I just passed by the garden

94
00:10:52,290 --> 00:10:53,820
and heard some officers say

95
00:10:53,890 --> 00:10:54,790
that Fifth Young Master Yu

96
00:10:54,790 --> 00:10:56,100
is trapped on the battlefield,

97
00:10:56,100 --> 00:10:57,200
out of ammunition and food,

98
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:58,390
and his life is hanging by a thread.

99
00:10:58,390 --> 00:10:59,460
Fifth Young Master Yu is Commander Yu's

100
00:10:59,460 --> 00:11:00,530
only son.

101
00:11:00,550 --> 00:11:02,550
Nothing would happen to him, right?

102
00:11:03,200 --> 00:11:04,100
No one can predict

103
00:11:04,100 --> 00:11:05,100
what happens on the battlefield.

104
00:11:05,100 --> 00:11:06,290
Bullets don't discriminate.

105
00:11:06,290 --> 00:11:07,170
I heard

106
00:11:07,290 --> 00:11:09,050
they were ambushed

107
00:11:09,050 --> 00:11:10,850
and the enemy had heavy weapons.

108
00:11:11,100 --> 00:11:12,150
I'm afraid he may not

109
00:11:12,150 --> 00:11:13,290
make it back this time.

110
00:11:13,290 --> 00:11:14,030
Chances are,

111
00:11:14,030 --> 00:11:15,000
he's done for.

112
00:11:19,740 --> 00:11:20,440
Pingjun!

113
00:11:24,390 --> 00:11:25,290
Don't move.

114
00:11:25,290 --> 00:11:27,150
I'll get a broom and clean this up.

115
00:11:32,740 --> 00:11:33,940
You're bleeding.

116
00:11:34,050 --> 00:11:35,380
I'll get some medicine.

117
00:11:43,530 --> 00:11:44,060
Pingjun.

118
00:11:50,410 --> 00:11:51,940
What happened to your hand?

119
00:11:55,150 --> 00:11:55,890
I'm fine.

120
00:11:56,750 --> 00:11:59,000
I just got a little cut by accident.

121
00:12:00,440 --> 00:12:01,500
Let me bandage it for you.

122
00:12:01,500 --> 00:12:02,080
No need.

123
00:12:11,650 --> 00:12:13,000
I need to clean this up.

124
00:12:13,670 --> 00:12:14,440
And I need to find

125
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:15,630
a new vase.

126
00:12:16,340 --> 00:12:17,010
Pingjun.

127
00:12:19,500 --> 00:12:20,840
I've already made it clear to her.

128
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:21,730
She has gone back to Japan

129
00:12:21,730 --> 00:12:23,730
and won't come looking for me again.

130
00:12:26,550 --> 00:12:28,050
Don't you get it yet?

131
00:12:28,290 --> 00:12:30,220
What I really care about isn't her.

132
00:12:31,890 --> 00:12:32,690
It's that you lied to her

133
00:12:32,690 --> 00:12:33,960
and then hid it from me.

134
00:12:37,940 --> 00:12:39,530
You don't trust me at all.

135
00:12:41,390 --> 00:12:41,960
Nor do you trust

136
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:43,620
the relationship between us.

137
00:13:04,470 --> 00:13:07,130
[Mingde Girls' High School
Graduation Ceremony]

138
00:14:13,820 --> 00:14:16,660
[Chunfeng Troupe]

139
00:14:16,690 --> 00:14:19,770
[Chunfeng Troupe Repertoire]

140
00:14:40,580 --> 00:14:41,870
Charge!

141
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:51,000
Charge!

142
00:14:52,950 --> 00:14:59,530
[Xing Newspaper]

143
00:15:21,460 --> 00:15:23,600
Kill them!

144
00:16:02,050 --> 00:16:05,660
[Luanjiang Gate]

145
00:16:13,790 --> 00:16:14,320
Hyah!

146
00:16:14,860 --> 00:16:15,290
Hyah!

147
00:16:15,310 --> 00:16:15,850
Hyah!

148
00:16:16,770 --> 00:16:17,130
Hyah!

149
00:16:19,170 --> 00:16:19,500
Hyah!

150
00:16:25,550 --> 00:16:28,220
[Luanjiang Gate]

151
00:16:38,210 --> 00:16:40,200
[Luanjiang Gate]

152
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:54,220
Enter the city.

153
00:17:15,300 --> 00:17:17,660
[Luanjiang Gate]

154
00:18:01,740 --> 00:18:04,970
[Yu Mansion]

155
00:18:05,900 --> 00:18:06,750
Be gentle.

156
00:18:06,780 --> 00:18:07,990
Don't be so clumsy.

157
00:18:07,350 --> 00:18:09,140
[Grasping the Moon]

158
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:10,940
Be careful, everyone.

159
00:18:10,940 --> 00:18:12,200
Don't break anything.

160
00:18:22,990 --> 00:18:24,720
Come here and let me take a look.

161
00:18:33,590 --> 00:18:34,400
Okay.

162
00:18:35,440 --> 00:18:37,270
The Fifth Young Master
is returning victorious today.

163
00:18:37,270 --> 00:18:38,470
What wonderful news!

164
00:18:38,880 --> 00:18:41,270
Everyone, look sharp
for tonight's family banquet.

165
00:18:41,270 --> 00:18:42,030
Yes.

166
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:00,850
Well done!

167
00:19:00,850 --> 00:19:01,660
Mighty is the Yu Army!

168
00:19:01,660 --> 00:19:03,520
Well done, Fifth Young Master Yu!

169
00:19:04,540 --> 00:19:06,270
Mighty is the Yu Army!

170
00:19:20,720 --> 00:19:21,920
Well done!

171
00:19:25,200 --> 00:19:26,910
One black suit.

172
00:19:27,270 --> 00:19:27,700
Right.

173
00:19:27,720 --> 00:19:29,550
One navy blue mandarin jacket.

174
00:19:29,790 --> 00:19:30,480
Here.

175
00:19:30,640 --> 00:19:32,480
One light pink qipao.

176
00:19:32,570 --> 00:19:33,400
These three?

177
00:19:33,610 --> 00:19:33,940
Okay.

178
00:19:34,290 --> 00:19:36,150
Two pairs of white leather shoes.

179
00:19:36,440 --> 00:19:38,140
The streets were buzzing today.

180
00:19:38,140 --> 00:19:39,500
I think everyone in Nanhai

181
00:19:39,500 --> 00:19:40,420
went to the city gate

182
00:19:40,420 --> 00:19:42,070
to welcome the Yu Army
returning in triumph.

183
00:19:42,070 --> 00:19:43,790
The Fifth Young Master Yu was so majestic.

184
00:19:43,790 --> 00:19:45,880
Just one look at him
was enough to make your heart flutter.

185
00:19:45,880 --> 00:19:46,840
Look.

186
00:19:47,070 --> 00:19:48,240
He's all over

187
00:19:48,240 --> 00:19:50,120
the front page.

188
00:19:50,700 --> 00:19:53,140
"The Battle That Made
Fifth Young Master Yu a National Hero:

189
00:19:52,890 --> 00:19:57,140
[Nanhuai Evening News]

190
00:19:53,160 --> 00:19:55,360
A Bloody Fightback

191
00:19:55,480 --> 00:19:57,690
and the Recapture of Luanjiang City"

192
00:19:58,080 --> 00:19:59,770
Fifth Young Master Yu is incredible.

193
00:19:59,770 --> 00:20:00,440
He sure is.

194
00:20:00,570 --> 00:20:01,550
The Fifth Young Master Yu is amazing.

195
00:20:01,550 --> 00:20:04,410
Absolutely.
The Yu Army lives up to its reputation.

196
00:20:05,090 --> 00:20:06,040
Caizhi.

197
00:20:06,440 --> 00:20:07,400
I'm ready.

198
00:20:07,400 --> 00:20:08,560
Let's go.

199
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:10,270
Pingjun.

200
00:20:10,290 --> 00:20:11,980
We need white leather shoes.

201
00:20:17,270 --> 00:20:18,070
Sorry.

202
00:20:19,750 --> 00:20:20,790
What's wrong?

203
00:20:21,330 --> 00:20:23,070
Are you feeling unwell?

204
00:20:26,200 --> 00:20:27,070
I'm fine.

205
00:20:27,740 --> 00:20:29,340
White leather shoes, right?

206
00:20:29,530 --> 00:20:30,240
Okay.

207
00:20:31,030 --> 00:20:31,900
Stop looking.

208
00:20:31,900 --> 00:20:33,180
Hurry up and organize the props.

209
00:20:33,180 --> 00:20:34,680
There are so many of them.

210
00:20:35,530 --> 00:20:36,660
Put this over there.

211
00:20:45,030 --> 00:20:45,980
Brothers!

212
00:20:47,030 --> 00:20:48,510
Yu Changxuan,

213
00:20:48,850 --> 00:20:51,440
Army Commander
of the Yu Army's Ninth Army,

214
00:20:51,740 --> 00:20:54,400
led our forces
to annihilate over 10,000 troops

215
00:20:54,400 --> 00:20:58,610
of the Qi Army in the Battle of Luanjiang

216
00:20:59,330 --> 00:21:01,500
and recapture the city!

217
00:21:02,140 --> 00:21:05,680
He is hereby awarded
the First-Class Medal of Merit

218
00:21:07,180 --> 00:21:08,660
and appointed

219
00:21:09,350 --> 00:21:12,500
Deputy Commander-in-Chief of the Yu Army!

220
00:21:56,300 --> 00:21:57,510
[First-Class Medal of Merit]

221
00:22:06,330 --> 00:22:08,140
Greetings, Deputy Commander-in-Chief!

222
00:22:08,140 --> 00:22:09,660
Greetings, Deputy Commander-in-Chief!

223
00:22:09,660 --> 00:22:11,350
Greetings, Deputy Commander-in-Chief!

224
00:22:11,350 --> 00:22:13,680
Greetings, Deputy Commander-in-Chief!

225
00:22:41,440 --> 00:22:43,640
My son was on the battlefield for a year.

226
00:22:44,530 --> 00:22:45,500
Someone here has had him on his mind

227
00:22:45,500 --> 00:22:47,830
and talked about him constantly.

228
00:22:48,480 --> 00:22:50,240
Now that he's back,

229
00:22:50,260 --> 00:22:51,640
having distinguished himself in battle,

230
00:22:51,640 --> 00:22:52,570
this person

231
00:22:53,330 --> 00:22:55,390
can't even spare him a few kind words.

232
00:22:56,700 --> 00:22:58,100
Are you talking about me?

233
00:23:08,900 --> 00:23:09,700
Fine.

234
00:23:10,590 --> 00:23:11,400
I'll say it.

235
00:23:12,750 --> 00:23:14,410
You fought like a real soldier

236
00:23:16,070 --> 00:23:17,640
in the Battle of Luanjiang.

237
00:23:20,680 --> 00:23:21,590
That's it?

238
00:23:22,200 --> 00:23:23,380
This Commander-in-Chief

239
00:23:23,380 --> 00:23:24,940
is really a man of few words.

240
00:23:26,920 --> 00:23:27,350
Here.

241
00:23:28,180 --> 00:23:28,980
Changxuan.

242
00:23:30,090 --> 00:23:30,830
I heard

243
00:23:30,830 --> 00:23:32,590
that when they carried you back to camp,

244
00:23:32,590 --> 00:23:34,000
you were covered in blood.

245
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:35,200
Your left arm was blown apart,

246
00:23:35,200 --> 00:23:36,400
with the bone exposed.

247
00:23:36,400 --> 00:23:37,940
You nearly lost your arm.

248
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:38,980
It wasn't that bad.

249
00:23:38,980 --> 00:23:40,780
Don't listen to their nonsense.

250
00:23:41,750 --> 00:23:42,550
Changxuan.

251
00:23:43,770 --> 00:23:44,770
I think you should

252
00:23:44,980 --> 00:23:47,240
have a doctor examine you more thoroughly.

253
00:23:47,240 --> 00:23:48,700
I'm fine. I've recovered.

254
00:23:49,180 --> 00:23:50,890
My injuries are nothing

255
00:23:50,910 --> 00:23:52,040
on the battlefield.

256
00:23:53,740 --> 00:23:57,070
So many never made it home.

257
00:24:08,090 --> 00:24:10,290
Once you've chosen to be a soldier,

258
00:24:12,770 --> 00:24:14,900
you have to be ready
to lay down your life.

259
00:24:14,900 --> 00:24:17,480
Once you take up a gun,
you have to charge into battle.

260
00:24:17,480 --> 00:24:19,280
There's no room for hesitation.

261
00:24:23,590 --> 00:24:24,380
This time,

262
00:24:25,070 --> 00:24:27,250
Changxuan not only reclaimed
the lost territory

263
00:24:27,250 --> 00:24:28,850
but also kept his cool
and commanded his troops

264
00:24:28,850 --> 00:24:30,780
under fire despite being wounded,

265
00:24:30,920 --> 00:24:32,800
ultimately holding the line.

266
00:24:33,050 --> 00:24:34,660
His courage and fighting spirit

267
00:24:34,660 --> 00:24:35,900
not only struck fear into the enemy

268
00:24:35,900 --> 00:24:37,550
and earned him respect within the army,

269
00:24:37,550 --> 00:24:38,810
but also brought honor

270
00:24:38,920 --> 00:24:40,200
to the Yu Army.

271
00:24:41,850 --> 00:24:42,330
Dad,

272
00:24:42,980 --> 00:24:44,780
you can really rest assured now.

273
00:24:54,590 --> 00:24:55,590
Try this.

274
00:24:57,440 --> 00:24:58,640
As the saying goes,

275
00:24:59,030 --> 00:25:00,440
there are two great joys in life:

276
00:25:00,440 --> 00:25:02,640
passing the imperial exams
and getting married.

277
00:25:02,640 --> 00:25:04,570
I'd say your triumphant return

278
00:25:04,570 --> 00:25:06,700
counts as passing with flying colors.

279
00:25:07,400 --> 00:25:08,900
So, when do you plan

280
00:25:09,070 --> 00:25:10,480
to hold the wedding?

281
00:25:10,790 --> 00:25:12,250
Should I find a fortune-teller

282
00:25:12,250 --> 00:25:13,330
to pick an auspicious date?

283
00:25:13,330 --> 00:25:13,740
Mom.

284
00:25:14,890 --> 00:25:16,980
I've only just returned
from the battlefield,

285
00:25:16,980 --> 00:25:18,980
and there are still
a lot of military affairs to take care of,

286
00:25:18,980 --> 00:25:20,300
especially matters

287
00:25:20,420 --> 00:25:23,020
concerning the fallen soldiers
of the Yu Army.

288
00:25:23,140 --> 00:25:24,420
I want to see to

289
00:25:24,720 --> 00:25:26,530
their final arrangements myself.

290
00:25:26,530 --> 00:25:28,530
I'm afraid this isn't the right time

291
00:25:28,830 --> 00:25:30,030
to discuss marriage.

292
00:25:31,070 --> 00:25:32,260
Yes, yes.

293
00:25:32,570 --> 00:25:33,700
Well,

294
00:25:33,700 --> 00:25:34,900
I've been so caught up

295
00:25:34,900 --> 00:25:37,100
in wanting Ziyi as my daughter-in-law.

296
00:25:37,270 --> 00:25:39,140
You are more thoughtful.

297
00:25:39,530 --> 00:25:40,770
We shouldn't handle

298
00:25:41,070 --> 00:25:42,930
these two things at the same time.

299
00:25:45,290 --> 00:25:47,590
On the battlefield,
bullets are flying everywhere,

300
00:25:47,590 --> 00:25:49,440
and lives are at stake.

301
00:25:49,940 --> 00:25:51,050
We should give Changxuan

302
00:25:51,050 --> 00:25:52,830
some time to recover.

303
00:25:53,090 --> 00:25:55,880
That way, I'll also have a chance
to look after him

304
00:25:56,140 --> 00:25:57,330
and spend more time with him.

305
00:25:57,330 --> 00:25:58,050
Yes.

306
00:25:59,590 --> 00:26:00,650
Let's eat. Come on.

307
00:26:06,610 --> 00:26:15,330
[Yu Mansion]

308
00:26:21,350 --> 00:26:22,110
Ziyi.

309
00:26:25,000 --> 00:26:26,590
I have something to tell you.

310
00:26:26,590 --> 00:26:28,000
You just got back.

311
00:26:28,200 --> 00:26:29,330
You need a good rest.

312
00:26:29,940 --> 00:26:31,830
Besides, I promised my father

313
00:26:31,830 --> 00:26:33,680
I'd go back and help him
take care of a few things today.

314
00:26:33,680 --> 00:26:34,700
I have to go now.

315
00:26:36,480 --> 00:26:37,200
Ziyi.

316
00:26:45,810 --> 00:26:48,390
[Yu Mansion]

317
00:26:55,830 --> 00:26:57,420
[Yu Mansion]

318
00:26:58,760 --> 00:27:00,540
[Yu Mansion]

319
00:27:19,060 --> 00:27:22,240
[Guanyin Pavilion]

320
00:27:28,620 --> 00:27:31,370
[In Memory of Sun Xuewu]
[In Memory of He Dapeng]

321
00:27:32,900 --> 00:27:33,980
I'm waiting for you

322
00:27:33,980 --> 00:27:35,740
to announce to the entire army,

323
00:27:35,810 --> 00:27:37,110
"Sergeant Sun Xuewu

324
00:27:37,220 --> 00:27:39,500
has proven himself brave in battle
and brilliant in strategy.

325
00:27:37,700 --> 00:27:42,530
[In Memory of Sun Xuewu]
[In Memory of Xu Shaoxuan]

326
00:27:39,770 --> 00:27:42,970
He is hereby promoted
to staff officer of the Ninth Army."

327
00:27:43,770 --> 00:27:44,430
Commander,

328
00:27:44,750 --> 00:27:45,770
actually, when you

329
00:27:45,770 --> 00:27:47,070
handed me this horse,

330
00:27:47,330 --> 00:27:48,860
I'd already made up my mind.

331
00:27:48,880 --> 00:27:49,570
The Yu Army is missing

332
00:27:49,570 --> 00:27:50,700
a cavalry unit.

333
00:27:51,030 --> 00:27:51,850
How about I train

334
00:27:51,850 --> 00:27:53,310
a cavalry company for you?

335
00:27:53,420 --> 00:27:54,590
As escorts,

336
00:27:54,640 --> 00:27:58,090
[In Memory of He Dapeng]
[In Memory of Guan Bao]

337
00:27:54,880 --> 00:27:56,810
loyalty and honor are in our blood.

338
00:27:59,180 --> 00:28:00,420
When war breaks out,

339
00:28:01,270 --> 00:28:03,600
no one plants crops in the fields anymore.

340
00:28:04,030 --> 00:28:04,530
Instead, the fields are filled

341
00:28:04,530 --> 00:28:05,940
with the bodies of the dead.

342
00:28:05,450 --> 00:28:08,460
[In Memory of He Dapeng]
[In Memory of Yuan Huai]

343
00:28:07,960 --> 00:28:14,480
♪ Mother, who knows
how much you miss me? ♪

344
00:28:14,750 --> 00:28:19,290
[In Memory of Guan Bao]

345
00:28:16,070 --> 00:28:22,850
♪ I dream of you, Mother, in my sleep ♪

346
00:28:23,850 --> 00:28:28,850
♪ Mother, oh, Mother ♪

347
00:28:37,400 --> 00:28:38,350
Commander...

348
00:28:38,010 --> 00:28:40,030
[Mother, Mrs. Zhang]

349
00:28:39,310 --> 00:28:42,170
Make sure these get delivered.

350
00:28:51,010 --> 00:28:52,940
These are their farewell letters.

351
00:28:54,610 --> 00:28:55,530
Make sure to deliver them

352
00:28:55,530 --> 00:28:56,590
to their families.

353
00:29:08,030 --> 00:29:10,360
Find Guan Bao's mother as soon as possible

354
00:29:10,770 --> 00:29:13,370
and make sure
she's provided for in her old age.

355
00:29:13,940 --> 00:29:15,000
He Dapeng's family

356
00:29:15,940 --> 00:29:16,530
must receive

357
00:29:16,530 --> 00:29:18,530
the same compensation as the family

358
00:29:19,110 --> 00:29:20,910
of a cavalry company commander.

359
00:29:21,310 --> 00:29:22,570
Find a plot of farmland

360
00:29:24,070 --> 00:29:26,200
in the suburbs for Yuan Huai's family.

361
00:29:28,050 --> 00:29:28,850
Changxuan,

362
00:29:29,310 --> 00:29:30,250
don't worry.

363
00:29:30,270 --> 00:29:32,000
We'll take care of everything.

364
00:29:32,030 --> 00:29:33,070
And Sun Xuewu...

365
00:29:33,880 --> 00:29:34,680
I know.

366
00:29:36,220 --> 00:29:38,070
I'll send an official letter to his family

367
00:29:38,070 --> 00:29:40,070
in the name of the staff department.

368
00:29:40,070 --> 00:29:41,600
I'll make sure to emphasize

369
00:29:42,980 --> 00:29:44,840
that he was a valued staff officer

370
00:29:46,140 --> 00:29:47,880
of the Ninth Army of the Yu Army.

371
00:29:52,680 --> 00:29:54,010
You two go get some rest.

372
00:29:55,220 --> 00:29:57,220
I'll stay with them a little longer.

373
00:30:22,770 --> 00:30:23,720
Japanese soldiers

374
00:30:23,720 --> 00:30:25,110
shot and killed two Changsha civilians,

375
00:30:25,110 --> 00:30:26,070
committing murder in broad daylight.

376
00:30:26,070 --> 00:30:27,180
Protests and demonstrations

377
00:30:27,180 --> 00:30:28,620
have erupted across the country,
led primarily

378
00:30:28,620 --> 00:30:29,740
by workers and students.

379
00:30:29,740 --> 00:30:31,410
Director Liang and Ruoru will focus on

380
00:30:31,410 --> 00:30:33,150
contacting
Nanhai's Federation of Trade Unions,

381
00:30:33,150 --> 00:30:34,980
the Student Union,
and the Patriotic Weekly

382
00:30:34,980 --> 00:30:36,610
to publish anti-Japanese articles.

383
00:30:36,610 --> 00:30:37,540
As for us,

384
00:30:37,560 --> 00:30:39,310
we'll focus on
putting on performances around Nanhai.

385
00:30:39,310 --> 00:30:40,350
Our main message will be

386
00:30:40,350 --> 00:30:41,880
to boycott Japanese goods.

387
00:30:41,880 --> 00:30:43,400
The Japanese are simply lawless.

388
00:30:43,400 --> 00:30:44,660
They have gone too far.

389
00:30:44,700 --> 00:30:45,850
We must do our part.

390
00:30:47,220 --> 00:30:48,810
We'll work separately.

391
00:30:48,810 --> 00:30:49,920
I'll write the scripts,

392
00:30:49,920 --> 00:30:51,240
and you find venues.

393
00:30:51,330 --> 00:30:51,950
We'll try

394
00:30:51,980 --> 00:30:53,400
to coordinate our performances

395
00:30:53,400 --> 00:30:54,860
with the protest marches.

396
00:30:56,460 --> 00:30:56,830
Look!

397
00:30:56,980 --> 00:30:57,420
Deputy Commander-in-Chief Yu is here!

398
00:30:57,420 --> 00:30:59,440
Deputy Commander-in-Chief Yu
returned in triumph.

399
00:30:59,440 --> 00:31:01,480
All officers and soldiers
are invited to enjoy the opera.

400
00:31:01,480 --> 00:31:03,280
Deputy Commander-in-Chief Yu.

401
00:31:43,160 --> 00:31:47,950
[Xiangxi Hotel]

402
00:31:49,090 --> 00:31:49,790
Officers.

403
00:31:49,790 --> 00:31:51,420
I'm the troupe leader.

404
00:31:51,460 --> 00:31:52,740
Fifth Young Master Yu has instructed me

405
00:31:52,740 --> 00:31:54,840
to arrange whatever plays

406
00:31:55,000 --> 00:31:56,000
you'd like to see.

407
00:31:56,000 --> 00:31:57,530
What are you talking about?

408
00:32:00,160 --> 00:32:01,400
Deputy Commander-in-Chief Yu.

409
00:32:01,400 --> 00:32:02,750
Deputy Commander-in-Chief Yu.

410
00:32:02,750 --> 00:32:03,550
Deputy Commander-in-Chief Yu.

411
00:32:03,550 --> 00:32:04,350
Deputy Commander-in-Chief Yu.

412
00:32:04,350 --> 00:32:05,460
Deputy Commander-in-Chief Yu.

413
00:32:05,460 --> 00:32:06,460
Please, don't stand on ceremony.

414
00:32:06,460 --> 00:32:08,320
Just sit back and enjoy the opera.

415
00:32:14,660 --> 00:32:15,320
Commander,

416
00:32:15,540 --> 00:32:17,240
what would you like to see today?

417
00:32:17,240 --> 00:32:18,110
The usual.

418
00:32:18,250 --> 00:32:18,850
You got it.

419
00:32:23,720 --> 00:32:26,650
[Resounding Arias]

420
00:33:01,380 --> 00:33:03,780
It's all thanks to
the brother's hard work.

421
00:33:19,850 --> 00:33:20,660
You've seen Dingjun Mountain

422
00:33:20,660 --> 00:33:21,550
so many times.

423
00:33:21,550 --> 00:33:22,640
How are you still so engrossed?

424
00:33:22,640 --> 00:33:24,030
If you don't like it,

425
00:33:24,200 --> 00:33:25,530
go do your own business.

426
00:33:25,660 --> 00:33:26,960
What I mean is,

427
00:33:27,000 --> 00:33:28,680
don't spend all your time
watching the opera.

428
00:33:28,680 --> 00:33:30,040
Why don't you go see the woman

429
00:33:30,040 --> 00:33:31,570
you've been longing to see?

430
00:33:35,400 --> 00:33:37,600
Miss Ye is upstairs on the second floor.

431
00:33:44,200 --> 00:33:45,060
What do you say?

432
00:33:45,250 --> 00:33:47,030
Are you going up to see her yourself,

433
00:33:47,030 --> 00:33:49,120
or should I bring her down?

434
00:33:49,400 --> 00:33:50,830
Why should I go up?

435
00:33:54,240 --> 00:33:55,200
Stubborn, aren't you?

436
00:33:55,200 --> 00:33:55,790
Fine.

437
00:33:55,940 --> 00:33:58,270
I might as well
play the good guy to the end.

438
00:33:58,350 --> 00:33:59,850
I'll go invite her down.

439
00:34:19,590 --> 00:34:20,280
Miss Ye.

440
00:34:20,710 --> 00:34:21,300
How long have you been

441
00:34:21,300 --> 00:34:21,900
peeking at our Fifth Young Master Yu

442
00:34:21,900 --> 00:34:22,760
from here?

443
00:34:25,400 --> 00:34:27,260
I rarely

444
00:34:27,260 --> 00:34:28,530
see you

445
00:34:28,530 --> 00:34:30,500
flustered like this.

446
00:34:35,340 --> 00:34:37,460
I just happen
to have a few words of thanks

447
00:34:37,460 --> 00:34:39,190
to say to Fifth Young Master Yu.

448
00:34:39,670 --> 00:34:40,850
Isn't that perfect?

449
00:34:41,000 --> 00:34:41,980
They say when fate
brings two people together,

450
00:34:41,980 --> 00:34:43,010
there's no escaping it.

451
00:34:43,010 --> 00:34:43,920
You two just happened
to run into each other

452
00:34:43,920 --> 00:34:44,820
at the theater.

453
00:34:44,900 --> 00:34:45,900
If you have anything private to say,

454
00:34:45,900 --> 00:34:47,260
you can say it to his face.

455
00:34:47,260 --> 00:34:48,460
Otherwise, how would he know?

456
00:34:48,460 --> 00:34:48,980
Right?

457
00:34:49,760 --> 00:34:50,110
Come.

458
00:34:52,530 --> 00:34:53,130
Come on.

459
00:35:04,610 --> 00:35:05,300
Miss Ye.

460
00:35:07,310 --> 00:35:09,310
Sit down and watch the opera with us.

461
00:35:12,920 --> 00:35:13,400
Fifth Young Master Yu.

462
00:35:13,400 --> 00:35:14,000
Boren.

463
00:35:15,000 --> 00:35:18,400
The actor playing Huang Zhong
is doing a fine job. Reward him.

464
00:35:33,510 --> 00:35:34,860
Okay, I'll go.

465
00:35:35,050 --> 00:35:35,810
Also...

466
00:35:37,300 --> 00:35:39,270
Don't bring irrelevant people

467
00:35:39,610 --> 00:35:40,900
in front of me anymore.

468
00:35:52,090 --> 00:35:54,230
Sorry to bother you.

469
00:35:54,940 --> 00:35:55,960
I'll be off now.

470
00:35:59,360 --> 00:36:00,050
Miss Ye.

471
00:36:00,530 --> 00:36:01,230
Miss Ye!

472
00:36:11,300 --> 00:36:12,860
Why did you have to say that?

473
00:36:12,860 --> 00:36:13,960
You obviously care about her

474
00:36:13,960 --> 00:36:15,100
very much.

475
00:36:15,730 --> 00:36:16,440
Remember.

476
00:36:18,190 --> 00:36:19,210
Don't mention her name

477
00:36:19,210 --> 00:36:20,340
in front of me again.

478
00:36:21,150 --> 00:36:22,300
I don't want to hear

479
00:36:22,300 --> 00:36:23,430
anything about her.

480
00:36:43,590 --> 00:36:44,860
This time, Fifth Young Master Yu

481
00:36:44,860 --> 00:36:47,900
has really distinguished himself in battle
and won people's hearts.

482
00:36:47,900 --> 00:36:50,190
I think his position
as his father's successor

483
00:36:50,190 --> 00:36:52,620
is now quite secure.

484
00:36:53,940 --> 00:36:54,940
Before, so many people

485
00:36:54,940 --> 00:36:56,940
were flattering Kuang Bingwen,

486
00:36:57,340 --> 00:37:00,840
thinking this son-in-law
could hold the fort alone.

487
00:37:01,860 --> 00:37:02,860
Now that

488
00:37:03,900 --> 00:37:07,590
they've realized
that they've chosen the wrong side,

489
00:37:09,260 --> 00:37:10,050
I'm afraid

490
00:37:11,050 --> 00:37:13,090
they're regretting it bitterly.

491
00:37:14,780 --> 00:37:17,040
With Fifth Young Master Yu taking power,

492
00:37:17,090 --> 00:37:19,070
the one who resents it the most

493
00:37:19,260 --> 00:37:21,120
must be Brigade Commander Kuang.

494
00:37:21,960 --> 00:37:24,230
After working like a horse
for so many years,

495
00:37:24,230 --> 00:37:25,210
a son-in-law

496
00:37:25,400 --> 00:37:27,190
is still an outsider, after all.

497
00:37:27,190 --> 00:37:28,820
In the end, he's just a stepping stone

498
00:37:28,820 --> 00:37:30,480
for the Commander's real son.

499
00:37:31,500 --> 00:37:32,760
You can say that again.

500
00:37:33,340 --> 00:37:35,820
This ideal son-in-law, in the end,

501
00:37:35,900 --> 00:37:39,260
is still just a dog
that isn't allowed at the table.

502
00:37:39,510 --> 00:37:40,280
Exactly.

503
00:37:44,000 --> 00:37:45,650
We should go in.

504
00:37:45,900 --> 00:37:47,400
I wonder if Taochun

505
00:37:47,400 --> 00:37:49,050
is out yet.

506
00:37:49,050 --> 00:37:50,340
Let's go take a look.

507
00:37:53,210 --> 00:37:54,760
B-Brigade Commander Kuang.

508
00:37:54,760 --> 00:37:56,220
Brigade Commander Kuang.

509
00:37:56,940 --> 00:37:58,670
It's a good thing I ran into you.

510
00:37:59,900 --> 00:38:02,560
Brigade Commander Kuang,
what can we do for you?

511
00:38:03,360 --> 00:38:04,890
I had a bit too much to drink.

512
00:38:05,110 --> 00:38:06,230
I want to go back.

513
00:38:06,650 --> 00:38:07,690
My car is parked

514
00:38:07,690 --> 00:38:08,840
in the alley ahead.

515
00:38:09,110 --> 00:38:11,610
Could you two help me over there?

516
00:38:12,860 --> 00:38:13,260
Here.

517
00:38:13,260 --> 00:38:14,460
This way, Commander.

518
00:38:21,980 --> 00:38:23,030
Brigade Commander Kuang.

519
00:38:23,030 --> 00:38:24,510
Where is your car?

520
00:38:25,340 --> 00:38:25,960
Yeah.

521
00:38:26,880 --> 00:38:27,880
Where is your car?

522
00:38:43,590 --> 00:38:44,210
Kneel.

523
00:38:46,380 --> 00:38:47,760
Brigade Commander Kuang...

524
00:38:47,760 --> 00:38:48,630
Spare my life.

525
00:38:50,050 --> 00:38:51,360
Was it you just now

526
00:38:52,360 --> 00:38:53,820
who said I was a dog?

527
00:39:15,320 --> 00:39:16,570
Bite down hard.

528
00:40:38,960 --> 00:40:40,110
There were so many people

529
00:40:40,110 --> 00:40:41,770
congratulating you tonight.

530
00:40:41,980 --> 00:40:43,280
I didn't even have a chance

531
00:40:43,280 --> 00:40:44,940
to have a drink with you alone.

532
00:40:47,420 --> 00:40:47,920
Here.

533
00:41:05,960 --> 00:41:07,220
You've had your drink,

534
00:41:07,840 --> 00:41:09,370
but you're still frowning.

535
00:41:11,230 --> 00:41:12,560
This celebratory drink

536
00:41:13,500 --> 00:41:14,700
doesn't taste right?

537
00:41:17,670 --> 00:41:18,640
Celebratory...

538
00:41:20,380 --> 00:41:21,500
I used to think

539
00:41:21,520 --> 00:41:22,450
I was omnipotent

540
00:41:24,070 --> 00:41:25,800
and could control everything.

541
00:41:26,820 --> 00:41:28,070
But when I actually
went to the battlefield,

542
00:41:28,070 --> 00:41:29,090
I realized

543
00:41:30,280 --> 00:41:32,010
how little was actually within

544
00:41:33,170 --> 00:41:34,420
my control.

545
00:41:39,320 --> 00:41:40,780
Those soldiers trusted me

546
00:41:43,280 --> 00:41:45,080
and entrusted their lives to me,

547
00:41:48,920 --> 00:41:50,650
but I couldn't bring them back.

548
00:41:53,840 --> 00:41:55,100
As long as there is war,

549
00:41:56,900 --> 00:41:58,300
there will be tragedies.

550
00:42:04,960 --> 00:42:07,530
Stopping war with war isn't ideal,

551
00:42:09,000 --> 00:42:10,260
but there's no denying

552
00:42:12,550 --> 00:42:13,690
that it's a way to achieve

553
00:42:13,690 --> 00:42:14,890
peace and stability.

554
00:42:17,480 --> 00:42:18,650
But since I was a child,
I've watched my father

555
00:42:18,650 --> 00:42:19,900
and those uncles

556
00:42:20,840 --> 00:42:22,070
fight tooth and nail

557
00:42:23,070 --> 00:42:24,300
for power and profit.

558
00:42:26,150 --> 00:42:28,610
After bloody battles and countless deaths,

559
00:42:29,130 --> 00:42:32,130
the generals on both sides
shook hands and made peace.

560
00:42:33,300 --> 00:42:35,030
But the sons of those mothers

561
00:42:37,690 --> 00:42:39,070
could never return.

562
00:42:43,690 --> 00:42:44,840
What is the meaning

563
00:42:47,650 --> 00:42:48,760
of such a war?

564
00:42:51,260 --> 00:42:52,380
You're right.

565
00:42:53,530 --> 00:42:54,760
War can stop violence

566
00:42:55,590 --> 00:42:57,790
and resist aggression and atrocities.

567
00:42:58,880 --> 00:42:59,940
But a civil war,

568
00:43:00,690 --> 00:43:02,860
where Chinese people of the same nation

569
00:43:02,860 --> 00:43:03,960
kill each other,

570
00:43:06,840 --> 00:43:08,840
is an absolute tragedy.

571
00:43:20,960 --> 00:43:23,560
People who just came back
from the battlefield

572
00:43:24,650 --> 00:43:27,050
mostly have a murderous look
in their eyes.

573
00:43:27,690 --> 00:43:29,890
But in your eyes, Fifth Young Master Yu,

574
00:43:30,230 --> 00:43:31,610
I see compassion.

575
00:43:34,050 --> 00:43:36,250
An iron fist can forge a fierce general.

576
00:43:37,030 --> 00:43:39,290
But only benevolence and righteousness

577
00:43:40,360 --> 00:43:41,440
can make

578
00:43:43,130 --> 00:43:46,460
a good general who protects the people
and brings peace to the world.

579
00:43:46,460 --> 00:43:47,150
Jin.

580
00:43:49,860 --> 00:43:51,660
Why do I feel like you're talking

581
00:43:53,010 --> 00:43:54,540
to someone else through me?

582
00:43:55,840 --> 00:43:56,970
Fifth Young Master.

583
00:43:58,360 --> 00:43:59,690
You've changed.

584
00:44:00,800 --> 00:44:01,570
How so?

585
00:44:04,840 --> 00:44:06,170
You're just different.

586
00:44:58,800 --> 00:45:00,060
You're not asleep yet?

587
00:45:00,900 --> 00:45:01,960
I was just about to.

588
00:45:10,360 --> 00:45:12,490
Does it have to be like this every time?

589
00:45:12,590 --> 00:45:13,940
Every time I come back
from the battlefield,

590
00:45:13,940 --> 00:45:15,530
barely making it back alive,

591
00:45:15,530 --> 00:45:17,380
you remain completely indifferent.

592
00:45:17,380 --> 00:45:20,590
It seems that whether I live or die,

593
00:45:21,630 --> 00:45:22,550
your heart

594
00:45:23,780 --> 00:45:25,570
won't even skip a beat.

595
00:45:26,550 --> 00:45:28,190
You know I don't like drunks.

596
00:45:39,050 --> 00:45:40,500
At the gathering today,

597
00:45:41,150 --> 00:45:42,610
they took turns toasting.

598
00:45:43,530 --> 00:45:45,070
I drank too much.

599
00:45:45,900 --> 00:45:47,340
I don't even know

600
00:45:48,230 --> 00:45:49,430
when I got scratched.

601
00:45:51,820 --> 00:45:54,460
A battle-hardened man like you,
Brigade Commander Kuang,

602
00:45:54,460 --> 00:45:55,650
can get hurt?

603
00:45:56,550 --> 00:45:59,550
You should be more careful in the future.

604
00:46:06,260 --> 00:46:07,340
Aren't you curious

605
00:46:09,090 --> 00:46:10,500
about what I did outside?

606
00:46:13,150 --> 00:46:14,500
As long as you keep being

607
00:46:14,500 --> 00:46:16,360
the Yu family's good son-in-law,

608
00:46:16,860 --> 00:46:18,730
I won't look into anything

609
00:46:19,650 --> 00:46:21,190
you don't want me to see.

610
00:46:42,630 --> 00:46:47,340
[Yu Mansion]
